  (text "PROVISIONAL DC LINK — input fuse, polarity/reverse-current protection and precharge are not implemented.\n8 x 220 uF / 100 V: nominal 1.76 mF, minimum 1.408 mF from capacitance tolerance alone.\nNichicon UHW2A221MHD: body 12.5 x 25 mm, lead pitch 5 mm. Allow vent and enclosure clearance.\nBleed: 20 kohm total, 0.157 W at 56 V, nominal 56-to-5 V decay 85.1 s with source removed.\nThis bleed cannot absorb motor regeneration. No discharge time guarantee or safe-to-touch indication.\nBank ripple sharing, thermal/lifetime, precharge energy and fault energy remain to qualify."
    (at 35 195 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "55c876ab-fc27-4b86-b1e4-f83463080e40")
  )
